### 🛠️ The MAID Micro-services Architecture

Instead of running a single massive process, MAID can be split into specialized, low-overhead daemon processes that communicate over fast local protocols (like HTTP/gRPC, Unix sockets, or MCP).

```
               ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
               │         VSCodium / IDE Frontend      │
               │  (Cline / Roo Code / Custom Extension)│
               └──────────────────┬───────────────────┘
                                  │ (MCP / JSON-RPC)
                                  ▼
               ┌──────────────────────────────────────┐
               │          MAID Orchestrator           │  ◄─── [SearXNG Service]
               │   (Lightweight LangGraph / Python)   │       (Web Search)
               └──────┬────────────────────────┬──────┘
                      │ (Local API)            │ (Local API)
                      ▼                        ▼
         ┌────────────────────────┐       ┌────────────────────────┐
         │     OmniRoute Service  │       │    Headroom Service    │
         │  (Unified API Gateway) │       │ (Context Compression)  │
         └────────────┬───────────┘       └────────────────────────┘
                      │
                      ▼
         ┌────────────────────────┐
         │    LLM Providers       │
         │ (Gemini, DeepSeek, etc)│
         └────────────────────────┘
```

